        63.09400177001953,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        82.912109375,
        213.58639526367188,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 17 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        106.6666259765625,
        510.2415771484375,
        122.00062561035156
      ],
      "text": "In infants whose HIV status is unknown and who are born to HIV-positive moth-",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        119.86663818359375,
        513.2886352539062,
        135.2006378173828
      ],
      "text": "ers and who lack symptoms suggestive of HIV, BCG vaccine should be given",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        133.066650390625,
        259.9913330078125,
        148.40065002441406
      ],
      "text": "after considering local factors",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        158.588134765625,
        397.16229248046875,
        171.93963623046875
      ],
      "text": "(Recommendation strength and evidence quality ungraded ) 1",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.8887939453125,
        183.39361572265625,
        513.4273071289062,
        196.7451171875
      ],
      "text": "Source: Revised BCG vaccination guidelines for infants at risk for HIV infection.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.8887939453125,
        197.12460327148438,
        367.9063415527344,
        210.54510498046875
      ],
      "text": "Weekly Epidemiological Record (2) , 2007, 82:193-196",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        219.12411499023438,
        513.3697509765625,
        232.54461669921875
      ],
      "text": "(5, 6)  BCG vaccine should not be used in children who are known to be HIV-positive",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        235.18963623046875,
        513.3698120117188,
        248.5411376953125
      ],
      "text": "because of the increased risk, reported from some settings, of severe and often fatal",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        251.11715698242188,
        248.00732421875,
        264.53765869140625
      ],
      "text": "(7, 8) disseminated BCG disease  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        272.7831726074219,
        513.4619140625,
        286.20367431640625
      ],
      "text": "bovis The diagnosis of BCG disease is difficult and the treatment is specialized: M.   is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        288.84869384765625,
        513.3697509765625,
        302.2001953125
      ],
      "text": "inherently resistant to pyrazinamide and thus all forms of BCG disease must be treated",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        304.84521484375,
        513.4503784179688,
        318.19671630859375
      ],
      "text": "using higher doses of other first-line TB medications. For example, some experts",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        320.8417053222656,
        513.4963989257812,
        334.1932067871094
      ],
      "text": "recommend a daily isoniazid dose of up to 20 mg/kg (maximum 300 mg) and a daily",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        336.83819580078125,
        513.3699951171875,
        350.189697265625
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin dose of up to 20 mg/kg (maximum 600 mg) for at least 9 months of therapy,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        352.76568603515625,
        513.4734497070312,
        366.1861877441406
      ],
      "text": "(9) as well as continuous monitoring for drug toxicity and response to therapy  . Children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        368.8311767578125,
        513.4273681640625,
        382.18267822265625
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV and suspected of having BCG disease should be referred to an appropriate",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        384.8276672363281,
        204.5142822265625,
        398.1791687011719
      ],
      "text": "expert for management.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        406.49365234375,
        513.4159545898438,
        419.84515380859375
      ],
      "text": "BCG-induced immune reconstitution inflammatory syndrome (BCG-IRIS) is increasingly",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        422.4901428222656,
        513.4157104492188,
        435.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "reported in infants living with HIV who have started ART early in infancy. BCG-IRIS can",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        438.48663330078125,
        513.4044799804688,
        451.838134765625
      ],
      "text": "cause significant morbidity although - unlike disseminated BCG disease – it is rarely",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        454.4831237792969,
        109.94979095458984,
        467.8346252441406
      ],
      "text": "fatal.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        476.14910888671875,
        513.4389038085938,
        489.5006103515625
      ],
      "text": "However, BCG is given routinely to newborns in TB-endemic settings and it is difficult",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        492.1455993652344,
        513.3698120117188,
        505.4971008300781
      ],
      "text": "to establish HIV infection status before the vaccine is administered. It is recognized that",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        508.14208984375,
        513.4159545898438,
        521.4935913085938
      ],
      "text": "practical implementation of this recommendation is complex and depending on the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        524.0696411132812,
        400.43975830078125,
        537.4901123046875
      ],
      "text": "(10) setting, particularly in relation to availability of HIV services  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        545.8045654296875,
        513.3927612304688,
        559.1560668945312
      ],
      "text": "HIV infection cannot be reliably determined at birth. Infants who are HIV-exposed but",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        561.8010864257812,
        513.4849243164062,
        575.152587890625
      ],
      "text": "uninfected will be at increased risk of disseminated TB disease if not vaccinated with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        577.7975463867188,
        513.4387817382812,
        591.1490478515625
      ],
      "text": "BCG. In settings endemic for TB/HIV, BCG should therefore continue to be given to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        593.7940673828125,
        513.42724609375,
        607.1455688476562
      ],
      "text": "infants who are born to HIV-positive mothers but who do not have any symptoms",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        609.7905883789062,
        222.4197998046875,
        623.14208984375
      ],
      "text": "suggestive of HIV infection.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        631.4566040039062,
        513.3929443359375,
        644.80810546875
      ],
      "text": "The following factors are likely to be important determinants of the risk-benefit balance",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0407943725586,
        647.3840942382812,
        229.92930603027344,
        660.8045654296875
      ],
      "text": "(10, 11) of such an approach  :",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        667.0038452148438,
        513.3984985351562,
        680.4703369140625
      ],
      "text": "coverage and success of the prevention of mother to child transmission of HIV  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        680.8038330078125,
        225.7144012451172,
        694.1553344726562
      ],
      "text": "(PMTCT) programme;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        700.2731323242188,
        513.3984375,
        713.7396240234375
      ],
      "text": "possibility of deferring BCG vaccination in HIV-exposed infants until HIV infection  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        714.0731201171875,
        257.24737548828125,
        727.4246215820312
      ],
      "text": "status has been established;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        733.5424194335938,
        390.75091552734375,
        747.0089111328125
      ],
      "text": "availability of early diagnosis of HIV infection in infants; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        753.6116943359375,
        340.7949523925781,
        767.0781860351562
      ],
      "text": "provision of early ART to HIV-positive infants. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        787.2747192382812,
        512.4326171875,
        799.2747192382812
      ],
      "text": "The Global Advisory Committee on Vaccine Safety (GACVS) does not use the GRADE methodology for evaluating the  1",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.21649932861328,
        796.8746948242188,
        395.9125061035156,
        808.8746948242188
      ],
      "text": "quality of evidence; the BCG-related recommendations will therefore remain ungraded.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "44",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}